index 43049a1..3150362 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -78,3 +78,15 @@ NASA_CURATION_DEVELOPMENT=true NASA_CURATION_WORKSPACE=/tmp/nasa-curation-demo N
 ```
 
 See [PHASE3C_CURATION_V1.md](docs/PHASE3C_CURATION_V1.md) and `artifacts/phase3c_curation_v1/` for actual PSI-98/NTRS publication, correction, rollback, query and validation receipts. Compatible quantity additions and guided review work; general prose preparation, unrestricted natural-language correction and general ontology evolution remain partial. Test-principal approval is not NASA institutional authorization.
+
+## Contextual scientific ingestion
+
+The existing incorporation service now supports immutable official NTRS submission and bounded, resumable scientific preparation:
+
+```bash
+uv run python scripts/curate_research.py --workspace /tmp/nasa-ingestion initialize
+uv run python scripts/curate_research.py --workspace /tmp/nasa-ingestion submit --ntrs-id 20150008961
+uv run python scripts/curate_research.py --workspace /tmp/nasa-ingestion prepare PACKAGE_ID --model --max-model-calls 2
+```
+
+Preparation works without an API key. It retains document structure, original table attributes, source spans, semantic proposals and grouped review dependencies in the existing isolated curation package. It grants no scientific approval. See [the Phase 1 implementation and acceptance report](docs/PHASE1_GENERALIZABLE_SCIENTIFIC_INGESTION.md): regression and preservation pass, but full Phase 1 acceptance remains incomplete because the bounded live unmodeled-source extraction failed.
